olor pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Boots%20of%20Haste\"><img alt=\"Boots of Haste\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Boots_of_Haste_d4312e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Leather Whip\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Leather_Whip_d459a2.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Goblet\"><img alt=\"Blood Goblet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blood_Goblet_86985b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.80<br/>July 21, 2015<br/>Summer Update 2015</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Edron Vampire Crypt</b> is a vampire crypt, similar to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire%20Crypts\">Vampire Crypts</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Drefia\">Drefia</a>, north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33109,31722,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33109, 31722, 7)</a>.\n</p><p>The teleporter <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33019,31605,11\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33019, 31605, 11)</a> will teleport you to the <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU3RvbmVfQmxvY2s/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"Stone Block (page does not exist)\">Stone Blocks</span> near the entrance of the cave, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33052,31698,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33052, 31698, 8)</a>. On the final floor, Bleed the Snake (Book) can be found <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32999,31593,11\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32999, 31593, 11)</a>.\n</p><p>The Edron Vampire Crypt is also one of the spots you have to cartograph during the <a href=\"#/quest/cartography-101-quest\">Cartography 101 Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"float: right; padding: 0 0 0.5em 0.5em;\">\n<div class=\"game-book-display\" style=\"width: 282px; height: 441px; border-width: 2px; border-style: solid; border-color: #767676 #2b2b2b #2b2b2b #767676; background-color: #393a3a; overflow: hidden; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.2em;\">\n<div class=\"header\" style=\"height: 14px; text-align: center; color: #8a8a8a; font-weight: bold; overflow: hidden;\">Show Text</div>\n<div class=\"content-container\" style=\"background-color: #4a4a49; height: 425px; color: #bfbfbf; font-weight: bold; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: #2b2b2b #787878 #787878 #2b2b2b;\">\n<div class=\"body\" style=\"width: 100%; margin: 6px 0; padding: 0 14px; text-align: left;\">\n<div class=\"header\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; height: 32px; width: 100%; position: relative;\">\n<div class=\"header-content\" style=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Large Book\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Large_Book_95d5af.gif\" width=\"50\"/></span><span class=\"book-title\" style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 0;\">You read the following.\n</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"content\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"text-container\" style=\"background-color: #363636; width: 248px; height: 314px; margin: 18px 0; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: #2b2b2b #777676 #777676 #2b2b2b; overflow-y: scroll; overflow-x: hidden;\">And you shall gently bleed the snake for it oozes life eternal.<br/><br/>And you shall bathe in its lotion and be girdled in youth.<br/><br/>And you shall relinquish the binding shackles of this world.<br/><br/>And you shall rejoice.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer\">\n<hr style=\"margin: 2px auto; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: #272727 transparent #767676 transparent; width: 260px;\"/>\n<div class=\"ok-box\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-style: solid; border-color: #767676 #2b2b2b #2b2b2b #767676; width: 41px; height: 18px; text-align: center; float: right; margin: 6px 12px 0 0;\">Go</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-First_Floor\">First Floor</span></h3>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton%20Warrior\"><img alt=\"Skeleton Warrior\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Skeleton_Warrior_d3d29b.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton%20Warrior\">Skeleton Warrior</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">45</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">65</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">43</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-10× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bone\">Bone</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Mushroom\">White Mushroom</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pelvis%20Bone\">Pelvis Bone</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brown%20Mushroom\">Brown Mushroom</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Mace (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sword\">Sword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\"><img alt=\"Ghoul\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ghoul_8f4d49.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">Ghoul</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">85</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">100</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">97 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">70 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">27 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Drain\"><img alt=\"Life Drain\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Life_Drain_Icon_bda9d3.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-30× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li